*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0002
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-03-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 766
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0002.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 WS-ATYP            PIC X.
    *> TRANSACTIONS THIS MONTH
    05 WS-MTC             PIC 9(3).
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    05 WS-XFEE            PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM CHARGE-EXCESS
    PERFORM BUSINESS-SURCHARGE
    DISPLAY "WS-XFEE=" WS-XFEE
    STOP RUN.
CHARGE-EXCESS.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    IF WS-MTC > 10
        COMPUTE WS-XFEE = (WS-MTC - 10) * 0.25
    END-IF.
BUSINESS-SURCHARGE.
    IF WS-ATYP = 'B' AND WS-MTC > 40
        ADD 10 TO WS-XFEE
    END-IF.
